      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Few more details about this one: This is a bug in the .22f1 Unity Engine, which we have included a fix for in our client builds. This will not fix it in editor for content creation of course, for which unfortunately you will have to wait until Unity fixes this issue in a public LTS version and we switch to it.\n\nSome forwarded info on what triggers this issue: \"[Unity] seems to be misselecting a UsePass candidate from a fallback shader because of a shared pass name\" - not sure I am able to provide more detailed info here, but perhaps that can lead you towards a workaround in your shader as well.",
